@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Pengguna as User
boundary HalamanTentangUI as TentangUI
control TentangController as Controller
entity KontenProvider as Konten

== Main Flow ==

User -> TentangUI : 1: Buka halaman tentang atau klik menu Tentang di navigasi
activate TentangUI
TentangUI -> Controller : 1.1: muatKontenTentang()
activate Controller
Controller -> Konten : 1.1.1: ambilKontenTentang()
activate Konten

alt [Konten berhasil dimuat]
    Konten --> Controller : 1.1.2: Konten halaman tentang
    Controller --> TentangUI : 1.1.3: Data konten
    TentangUI --> User : 1.1.4: Tampilkan halaman tentang\n(sejarah komunitas, visi dan misi, tujuan,\ncara bergabung, kontak resmi, link media sosial)
else [Gagal memuat konten]
    Konten --> Controller : 1.1.2a: Error
    Controller --> TentangUI : 1.1.3a: Error
    TentangUI --> User : 1.1.4a: Pesan error
end

deactivate Konten
deactivate Controller
deactivate TentangUI

@enduml
